{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：20:34 2026-11-19 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"TVB台慶2026丨羅嘉良驚喜重返TVB  打頭陣獻唱〈奇哥〉兩經典歌勾集體回憶\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl_square/a084d177014f8423bdc9210138106cc8/2026-11/KF_law.jpg\"/>\n<p>TVB台慶2026丨無綫集團年度盛事《萬千星輝賀台慶》於今晚11月19日（星期四）在將軍澳電視廣播城隆重舉行，慶祝TVB 59周年。久未回巢的三屆視帝羅嘉良，穿上一襲白色型格西裝外套，以及太陽眼鏡，於亮光儀式後，率領全台逾200位藝人打頭陣演出。</p>\n<h2>羅嘉良炒熱氣氛</h2>\n<p>羅嘉良一登場便勾起全場高呼，獻唱其經典代表作〈奇哥〉及〈難兄難弟〉，歌聲一出，瞬間將氣氛推向頂峰，逾200位藝員包括關嘉敏、陳楨怡、游嘉欣、劉佩玥、周嘉洛、林夏薇、高海寧、陳豪、馬國明、譚俊彥、羅子溢等分批出場，跟著羅嘉良演出起舞，場面壯觀。</p>\n<img alt=\"羅嘉良\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/caba6e1aab2c02eda05e0d8907f0f72e/2026-11/lau_4_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"羅嘉良\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/f73705b69343b29167c825ab66facacb/2026-11/lau_11_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"羅嘉良\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/f2deabdc5fad9bff44eafd027d7aedee/2026-11/lau_13_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"羅嘉良\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/ed8e9584c8a83ebc3296733cdce63859/2026-11/lau_14_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"羅嘉良\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/b9182b1b9f399da0e555944448e80f44/2026-11/lau_15_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"羅嘉良\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/0ebd4820c23fd0855a0c435bfd933288/2026-11/lau_16_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"羅嘉良\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/ff5a58eddbcebc277d8ca5398176473b/2026-11/lau_17_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"羅嘉良\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/d3ce5ca54744a7271d1c84038ad0a04b/2026-11/lau_18_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"羅嘉良\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/5d98347a0ef8c3cb3396dba23ccf2592/2026-11/lau_19_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"羅嘉良\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/7d901f6ea568e591347f7e8cf3310eba/2026-11/lau_20_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"羅嘉良\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/f8d01acc8a877f023404def75f9411fd/2026-11/lau_21_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"羅嘉良\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/a5e0cc826a6a8439cf35ad6095a70b06/2026-11/lau_22_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"羅嘉良\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/4675e63389e02676a85c0fd50b3c23f5/2026-11/lau_23_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"羅嘉良\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/46256f45ff122f171de7919cb1d75dd6/2026-11/lau_24_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"羅嘉良\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/684be9e042b20847c203b8afc1b23812/2026-11/lau_29_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"羅嘉良\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/84071f6720a6480f6044aff28cec5fa6/2026-11/lau_25_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"羅嘉良\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/90b95798d210f2c0b07d4cff9dd99cc6/2026-11/lau_26_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"羅嘉良\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/2e6cbbc6ffa845f0b9cb91529ba879cf/2026-11/lau_27_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"羅嘉良\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/d3fba6941dda0c24a945697d6ec8742f/2026-11/lau_28_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"羅嘉良\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/b9c2f043322fb77ceb18d80a38ce7153/2026-11/lau_30_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"羅嘉良\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/c96403ac5a2bc9e5f50ec6ea90c952e9/2026-11/lau_31_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"羅嘉良\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/81e968d6ad34e350a6fd66c02514d6c1/2026-11/lau_32_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"羅嘉良\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/8dc6249818429cfb67f631e7df7b15bc/2026-11/lau_33_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"羅嘉良\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/2aebaf45ff651e0b00a02a0e03d583d7/2026-11/lau_34_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"羅嘉良\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/75338b11b1489d23b1c186c487c90859/2026-11/lau_35_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"羅嘉良\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/7be8be7275e4fbc3eb62ead4ccfd071a/2026-11/lau_36_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"羅嘉良\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/c1810ff98c92e1f03c3fbfe329e7d36b/2026-11/lau_37_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"羅嘉良\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/96e9b835838f006a828d50e31e3617dd/2026-11/lau_38_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"羅嘉良\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/5d56700357818e5aa546d9d7a2cdc7ac/2026-11/lau_43_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"羅嘉良\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/124025e0da6b9ae4fe22b29a58d6f136/2026-11/lau_44_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"羅嘉良\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/df3c9e8abb9504319dcd361ee6379b0b/2026-11/lau_45_.jpeg\"/>\n<h2>汪明荃羅嘉良聚舊</h2>\n<p>表演結束後，大會司儀「阿姐」汪明荃與羅嘉良溫馨相擁，二人久未碰面，汪明荃興奮地對羅嘉良說：「你好，好耐冇見啊！歡迎你返嚟TVB！」而羅嘉良亦顯得十分激動表示：「好開心啊！非常Happy！」汪明荃又為羅嘉良打氣，連聲說道：「好，加油！加油！」互動真摯。隨後，羅嘉良在全場歡呼下，為台慶抽出第一位幸運兒。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T12:57:35.241857+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":439,"images":32,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T12:34:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T12:50:58.011528+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T12:50:58.011528+00:00","content_hash":"35212bbc1d28c1c2d02f91f1dcb94c3b48928735edd73745df765349948a447c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}